*zip*
# build artifacts
**/build_out/
**/build/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
**/__pycache__/
PROF_*/
*.pyc

# runtime / compile artifacts
**/kernel_meta/
**/extra-info/
**/*_profiling_output_record
*.pyc

# OPP install artifacts (regenerated by build_and_pack.sh / install step)
.indexadd_opp.*/
.indexadd_opp_path

# compiled python extensions
*.cpython-*.so

# profiling run outputs:
#   - keep milestone results.jsonl + referenced driver.log (small baselines)
#   - ignore per-case PROF_* raw data (already covered by PROF_*/ above),
#     parsed *.log, and c<case>_<mode>/ export dirs under baseline runs
IndexAdd/perf_v2/c*/
IndexAdd/perf_v2/*.log
IndexAdd/perf_atomic_optimized/c*/
IndexAdd/perf_atomic_optimized/*.log
# exploratory / intermediate profiling runs (not referenced by reports)
IndexAdd/perf_out/
IndexAdd/perf_optimized/
IndexAdd/perf_optimized_full/
IndexAdd/perf_optimized_full_driver.log
IndexAdd/perf_owner_recovered_3/
IndexAdd/perf_owner_metric_c03/

# one-shot env diagnostic probe (writes /tmp, not needed to reproduce)
IndexAdd/ld_check.py

# transient task tracker (ascendc-task-focus); experience lives in *.md reports
todo.md